msgid "Marosim turi"
msgstr "Event type"

msgid "Tayyor musiqalardan tanlash (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Choose from preset music (optional)"

msgid "— tanlanmagan —"
msgstr "— not selected —"

msgid "1-ism (masalan: kuyov, tug'ilgan kun egasi)"
msgstr "Name 1 (e.g. groom, birthday person)"

msgid "2-ism (ixtiyoriy, masalan: kelin)"
msgstr "Name 2 (optional, e.g. bride)"

msgid "Tadbir sanasi va vaqti"
msgstr "Event date and time"

msgid "To'yxona/manzil nomi"
msgstr "Venue name"

msgid "Manzil"
msgstr "Address"

msgid "Xarita havolasi (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Map link (optional)"

msgid "Kiyinish kodi (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Dress code (optional)"

msgid "O'zingiz musiqa yuklash (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Upload your own music (optional)"

msgid "Qo'shimcha tabrik matni (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Additional greeting text (optional)"

msgid "Sovg'a-pul uchun karta raqami (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Card number for monetary gifts (optional)"

msgid "Mehmonlar uchun Telegram guruhi (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Telegram group for guests (optional)"

msgid ""
"Taklifnomangiz sayt bosh sahifasida namuna sifatida boshqa mijozlarga "
"ko'rsatilishiga rozimisiz?"
msgstr ""
"Do you agree to have your invitation shown to other customers as an example "
"on the site's homepage?"

msgid "Masalan: kuyov, tug'ilgan kun egasi"
msgstr "E.g. groom, birthday person"

msgid "Ikkinchi ism (masalan: kelin). Kerak bo'lmasa bo'sh qoldiring"
msgstr "Second name (e.g. bride). Leave empty if not needed"

msgid "Masalan: rasmiy, yorug' ranglar"
msgstr "E.g.: formal, light colors"

msgid "O'zingiz yuklamoqchi bo'lsangiz"
msgstr "If you'd like to upload your own file"

msgid "Qo'shimcha tabrik/taklif matni"
msgstr "Additional greeting/invitation text"

msgid "Pul sovg'a uchun karta raqami"
msgstr "Card number for monetary gifts"

msgid "Mehmonlar uchun Telegram guruh/kanal havolasi"
msgstr "Telegram group/channel link for guests"

msgid ""
"Ixtiyoriy. Yoqmasangiz ham taklifnomangiz odatdagidek ishlayveradi — bu "
"faqat bosh sahifadagi namunalar ro'yxatiga tegishli."
msgstr ""
"Optional. Even if you don't enable this, your invitation will work as usual "
"— it only affects the list of examples on the homepage."

msgid "Bu marosim turi uchun ikkinchi ismni ham kiriting."
msgstr "For this event type, please enter the second name too."

msgid "Nikoh to'yi"
msgstr "Wedding"

msgid "Qiz uzatish"
msgstr "Bride's farewell"

msgid "Sunnat to'yi"
msgstr "Circumcision Celebration"

msgid "Beshik to'yi"
msgstr "Cradle celebration (beshik toy)"

msgid "Nahor oshi"
msgstr "Morning plov (nahor oshi)"

msgid "Yubiley"
msgstr "Anniversary"

msgid "Tug'ilgan kun"
msgstr "Birthday"

msgid "Boshqa"
msgstr "Other"

msgid "Zamonaviy"
msgstr "Modern"

msgid "Milliy"
msgstr "National"

msgid "Bolalar"
msgstr "Kids"

msgid "Dizaynlar"
msgstr "Designs"

msgid "Mening taklifnomalarim"
msgstr "My invitations"

msgid "Musiqani yoqish/o'chirish"
msgstr "Turn music on/off"

msgid "Taklifnoma yaratish"
msgstr "Create an invitation"

msgid "Tilni tanlang"
msgstr "Select language"

msgid "chiroyli raqamli taklifnomalar"
msgstr "beautiful digital invitations"

msgid "Eng go'zal kuningiz uchun"
msgstr "For your most beautiful day"

msgid "raqamli taklifnoma"
msgstr "a digital invitation"

msgid "Tez va oson"
msgstr "Fast and easy"

msgid "Telefonda o'zingiz yarating"
msgstr "Create it yourself on your phone"

msgid ""
"Dizaynni tanlang, ma'lumotlaringizni kiriting va tayyor taklifnomani shu "
"zahoti ko'ring — bor-yo'g'i 5 daqiqada, ro'yxatdan o'tmasdan. To'lov — faqat"
" yoqqanidan keyin."
msgstr ""
"Choose a design, enter your details and see your invitation instantly — in "
"just 5 minutes, no sign-up. Pay only if you love it."

msgid "Barcha dizaynlarni ko'rish"
msgstr "View all designs"

msgid "So'nggi taklifnomalar"
msgstr "Recent invitations"

msgid "Platformamizda faollashtirilgan taklifnomalardan namunalar"
msgstr "Examples of invitations activated on our platform"

msgid "Qanday ishlaydi?"
msgstr "How does it work?"

msgid "Uch oddiy qadam — va taklifnomangiz tayyor"
msgstr "Three simple steps — and your invitation is ready"

msgid "Dizayn tanlang"
msgstr "Choose a design"

msgid ""
"Bir nechta tayyor shablondan o'zingizga yoqqanini tanlang — har biri o'ziga "
"xos uslubda."
msgstr ""
"Pick your favorite from several ready-made templates — each with its own "
"style."

msgid "Ma'lumotlarni to'ldiring"
msgstr "Fill in the details"

msgid ""
"Marosim turi, ismlar, sana, manzil, rasmlar va musiqa — hammasini o'zingiz "
"kiritasiz."
msgstr ""
"Event type, names, date, address, photos and music — you enter everything "
"yourself."

msgid "Ulashing"
msgstr "Share it"

msgid ""
"Tayyor taklifnomani ko'rib chiqing, yoqsa faollashtiring va yaqinlaringizga "
"Telegram yoki Instagram orqali yuboring."
msgstr ""
"Preview your invitation, activate it if you like it, and send it to loved "
"ones via Telegram or Instagram."

msgid "Dizayn shablonlari"
msgstr "Design templates"

msgid "Tanlang va shu zahoti o'zingiznikini yaratib ko'ring"
msgstr "Pick one and create yours right away"

msgid "Barchasi"
msgstr "All"

msgid "so'm"
msgstr "UZS"

msgid "Bosh sahifa"
msgstr "Home"

msgid ""
"Bu ro'yxat sizning shu brauzerda yaratgan barcha taklifnomalaringizni "
"ko'rsatadi — ularni solishtirib, eng yoqqanini tanlashingiz mumkin."
msgstr ""
"This list shows all invitations you've created in this browser — compare "
"them and pick your favorite."

msgid "Yana bitta yaratish"
msgstr "Create another"

msgid "Faollashtirilgan"
msgstr "Activated"

msgid "To'lov kutilmoqda"
msgstr "Awaiting payment"

msgid "Ko'rish"
msgstr "View"

msgid "Yoqdi"
msgstr "Like"

msgid ""
"DIQQAT: bu taklifnoma FAOLLASHTIRILGAN — mehmonlarga yuborilgan va RSVP "
"javoblari bo'lishi mumkin! O'chirilsa, darhol ko'rinmay qoladi (30 kun "
"ichida administratorga murojaat qilib tiklash mumkin). Rostdan ham davom "
"etasizmi?"
msgstr ""
"WARNING: this invitation is ACTIVATED — it may have been sent to guests and "
"have RSVP replies! If deleted, it will disappear immediately (you can "
"contact the administrator within 30 days to restore it). Are you sure you "
"want to continue?"

msgid ""
"Rostdan ham ushbu taklifnomani butunlay o'chirmoqchimisiz? Bu amalni ortga "
"qaytarib bo'lmaydi."
msgstr ""
"Are you sure you want to permanently delete this invitation? This action "
"cannot be undone."

msgid "O'chirish"
msgstr "Delete"

msgid "Siz hali hech qanday taklifnoma yaratmagansiz."
msgstr "You haven't created any invitations yet."

msgid "Taklifnoma yopilgan"
msgstr "Invitation closed"

msgid "Ushbu taklifnoma sahifasi yopilgan"
msgstr "This invitation page is closed"

#, python-format
msgid "%(nomi)s bilan bog'liq sahifa endi faol emas."
msgstr "The page for %(nomi)s is no longer active."

msgid "Shablon tanlang"
msgstr "Choose a template"

msgid ""
"Sizga yoqqan dizaynni tanlang — keyingi bosqichda o'z ma'lumotlaringizni "
"to'ldirasiz."
msgstr ""
"Choose the design you like — you'll fill in your details in the next step."

msgid "Hozircha shablon yo'q. Admin panelda qo'shing."
msgstr "No templates yet. Add them in the admin panel."

msgid "kun"
msgstr "days"

msgid "soat"
msgstr "hours"

msgid "minut"
msgstr "minutes"

msgid "sekund"
msgstr "seconds"

msgid "Marosim kalendari"
msgstr "Event calendar"

msgid "Du Se Ch Pa Ju Sh Ya"
msgstr "Mo Tu We Th Fr Sa Su"

msgid "Fotolavha"
msgstr "Photo gallery"

msgid "Tadbir tafsilotlari"
msgstr "Event details"

msgid "Sana"
msgstr "Date"

msgid "Vaqt"
msgstr "Time"

msgid "To'yxona"
msgstr "Venue"

msgid "Kiyinish kodi"
msgstr "Dress code"

msgid "Tabrik sovg'asi"
msgstr "Gift"

msgid ""
"Ishtirokingiz — biz uchun eng qadrli sovg'a. Agar tabrik sovg'a qoldirmoqchi"
" bo'lsangiz:"
msgstr ""
"Your presence is the most precious gift to us. If you'd like to leave a "
"monetary gift:"

msgid "Nusxalandi!"
msgstr "Copied!"

msgid "RSVP — kelasizmi?"
msgstr "RSVP — will you come?"

msgid "Ismingiz"
msgstr "Your name"

msgid "Nechta kishi bo'lasiz?"
msgstr "How many people will you be?"

msgid "1 dan 5 gacha"
msgstr "From 1 to 5"

msgid "Kelasizmi?"
msgstr "Will you come?"

msgid "Ha, albatta kelaman"
msgstr "Yes, I'll definitely come"

msgid "Afsuski, kela olmayman"
msgstr "Unfortunately, I can't come"

msgid "Izoh (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Comment (optional)"

msgid "Yuborish"
msgstr "Submit"

msgid "Mehmonlar"
msgstr "Guests"

#, python-format
msgid "Hozircha <strong>%(soni)s</strong> kishi kelishini tasdiqladi"
msgstr "So far <strong>%(soni)s</strong> people have confirmed"

#, python-format
msgid "%(soni)s kishi"
msgstr "%(soni)s people"

msgid "Yangiliklar va suratlar uchun Telegram guruhimizga qo'shiling"
msgstr "Join our Telegram group for news and photos"

msgid "Telegram guruhi"
msgstr "Telegram group"

msgid "Do'stlaringizga ulashing"
msgstr "Share with friends"

msgid "Taklifnomani yaqinlaringizga ham yuboring"
msgstr "Send the invitation to your loved ones too"

msgid "Havolani nusxalash"
msgstr "Copy link"

#, python-format
msgid "Hurmatli %(ism)s, sizga taklifnoma keldi"
msgstr "Dear %(ism)s, you have an invitation"

msgid "Sizga taklifnoma keldi"
msgstr "You have an invitation"

msgid "Taklifnomani ochish"
msgstr "Open invitation"

msgid "Bu — sizning shaxsiy oldindan ko'rish havolangiz, hali ommaviy emas."
msgstr "This is your personal preview link — it isn't public yet."

msgid "Faollashtirish uchun Telegram orqali"
msgstr "To activate it, contact"

msgid "bilan bog'laning."
msgstr "on Telegram."

msgid "Yoqdi (yuborildi)"
msgstr "Liked (sent)"

msgid "Yoqdi — adminga yozish"
msgstr "Like — message admin"

msgid "Qayta yaratish"
msgstr "Create another"

msgid "Baxtli oilamizga"
msgstr "Time since our happy day"

msgid "yil"
msgstr "years"

msgid "bo'ldi"
msgstr " "

msgid "Marosimgacha"
msgstr "Until the event"

msgid "taklifnomasi"
msgstr "invitation"

msgid "Statistika"
msgstr "Statistics"

msgid "Ochiq sahifani ko'rish"
msgstr "View invitation"

#, python-format
msgid "%(nomi)s — statistika"
msgstr "%(nomi)s — statistics"

msgid "Bu sahifa faqat sizga ko'rinadi. Linkni hech kimga yubormang."
msgstr "This page is visible only to you. Don't share the link with anyone."

msgid "ko'rishlar"
msgstr "views"

msgid "javoblar"
msgstr "responses"

msgid "keladi (mehmon)"
msgstr "attending (guests)"

msgid "kelmaydi"
msgstr "not attending"

msgid "Ism"
msgstr "Name"

msgid "Holat"
msgstr "Status"

msgid "Mehmonlar soni"
msgstr "Number of guests"

msgid "Izoh"
msgstr "Comment"

msgid "Keladi"
msgstr "Attending"

msgid "Kelmaydi"
msgstr "Not attending"

msgid "Hozircha javoblar yo'q."
msgstr "No responses yet."

msgid "Mehmonlar uchun shaxsiy linklar"
msgstr "Personal links for guests"

msgid ""
"Admin panelda qo'shilgan har bir mehmonga shaxsiy link — shu linkni "
"Telegram/Instagram orqali o'sha mehmonning o'ziga yuboring."
msgstr ""
"A personal link for each guest added in the admin panel — send it to that "
"guest individually via Telegram/Instagram."

msgid "Ko'rdimi"
msgstr "Seen?"

msgid "Link"
msgstr "Link"

msgid "ko'rdi"
msgstr "seen"

msgid "hali ko'rmagan"
msgstr "not seen yet"

msgid ""
"Hali mehmon qo'shilmagan. Admin panelda taklifnoma ichida \"Mehmonlar\" "
"bo'limidan qo'shing."
msgstr ""
"No guests added yet. Add them from the \"Guests\" section inside the "
"invitation in the admin panel."

msgid "Tayyor!"
msgstr "Done!"

msgid "Taklifnomangiz tayyor!"
msgstr "Your invitation is ready!"

msgid "Bu — sizning shaxsiy havolangiz. Mehmonlaringizga shuni yuborasiz:"
msgstr "This is your personal link. Send it to your guests:"

msgid "Nusxalash"
msgstr "Copy"

msgid "Taklifnomani ko'rish"
msgstr "View invitation"

msgid ""
"Yuqoridagi tugma orqali taklifnomangizni ko'rib, hammasi to'g'ri ekanligiga "
"ishonch hosil qiling."
msgstr ""
"Open your invitation with the button above and make sure everything is "
"correct."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Yoqsa — taklifnoma sahifasidagi <strong>\"Yoqdi\"</strong> tugmasini bosing,"
" shu orqali to'g'ridan-to'g'ri Telegram orqali <strong>%(admin)s</strong> "
"bilan bog'lanib to'lovni amalga oshirasiz."
msgstr ""
"If you like it — press the <strong>\"Like\"</strong> button on the "
"invitation page to contact <strong>%(admin)s</strong> directly on Telegram "
"and make the payment."

msgid ""
"To'lov tasdiqlangach, taklifnomangiz faollashtiriladi va uni "
"mehmonlaringizga (Telegram, Instagram va h.k.) yuborishingiz mumkin bo'ladi."
msgstr ""
"Once payment is confirmed, your invitation is activated and you can send it "
"to your guests (Telegram, Instagram, etc.)."

msgid "shabloni"
msgstr "template"

msgid ""
"Ma'lumotlaringizni to'ldiring. Yuborgach — taklifnomangiz shu zahoti tayyor "
"bo'ladi (hali hech kimga ochiq emas)."
msgstr ""
"Fill in your details. Once submitted, your invitation will be ready right "
"away (not visible to anyone yet)."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sizda <strong>%(ism1)s %(ism2)s</strong> nomi bilan taklifnoma allaqachon "
"bor (shu brauzerda avval yaratilgan)."
msgstr ""
"You already have an invitation for <strong>%(ism1)s %(ism2)s</strong> "
"(created earlier in this browser)."

msgid "Nima qilamiz?"
msgstr "What should we do?"

msgid "Buni yangilayman (eskisi o'chadi)"
msgstr "Update it (the old one will be deleted)"

msgid "Yo'q, alohida saqlayman"
msgstr "No, keep it separate"

#, python-format
msgid "Rasmlar (eng ko'pi bilan %(soni)s ta, ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Photos (up to %(soni)s, optional)"

msgid "O'z fotoyingiz hali bo'lmasa, tayyor namunalardan tanlashingiz mumkin:"
msgstr ""
"If you don't have your own photo yet, you can choose from ready-made "
"samples:"

#, python-format
msgid "Namuna rasm %(soni)s"
msgstr "Sample photo %(soni)s"

msgid "yoki"
msgstr "or"

msgid "O'zingizning rasmingizni yuklang"
msgstr "Upload your own photo"

msgid "Taklifnomani yaratish"
msgstr "Create the invitation"

msgid "Boshqa shablon tanlash"
msgstr "Choose another template"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Eng ko'pi bilan %(soni)s ta rasm tanlashingiz mumkin. Iltimos, qaytadan "
"tanlang."
msgstr "You can select at most %(soni)s photos. Please choose again."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Fayl hajmi %(maks)s MB dan katta bo'lmasligi kerak (yuklangan fayl: "
"%(hajm).1f MB)."
msgstr "File size must not exceed %(maks)s MB (uploaded file: %(hajm).1f MB)."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"\"%(nomi)s\" fayli juda katta (%(hajm).1f MB). Rasm hajmi %(maks)s MB dan "
"oshmasligi kerak."
msgstr ""
"The file \"%(nomi)s\" is too large (%(hajm).1f MB). Photo size must not "
"exceed %(maks)s MB."

msgid "Iltimos, ismingizni kiriting."
msgstr "Please enter your name."

msgid "Javobingiz uchun rahmat!"
msgstr "Thank you for your response!"

msgid "Bu taklifnomani o'chira olmaysiz."
msgstr "You cannot delete this invitation."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"\"%(nomi)s\" taklifnomasi o'chirildi. Bu faollashtirilgan taklifnoma "
"bo'lgani uchun ma'lumotlari %(kun)s kun davomida saqlanadi — agar xato "
"bosgan bo'lsangiz, administratorga murojaat qiling."
msgstr ""
"The invitation \"%(nomi)s\" has been deleted. Since it was an activated "
"invitation, its data will be kept for %(kun)s days — if you did this by "
"mistake, contact the administrator."

#, python-format
msgid "\"%(nomi)s\" taklifnomasi o'chirildi."
msgstr "The invitation \"%(nomi)s\" has been deleted."

msgid "Sahifa topilmadi"
msgstr "Page not found"

msgid "Bunday sahifa topilmadi"
msgstr "No such page found"

msgid "Havola noto'g'ri yoki bu sahifa endi mavjud emas."
msgstr "The link is incorrect, or this page no longer exists."

msgid "Bosh sahifaga qaytish"
msgstr "Back to homepage"

msgid "Xatolik yuz berdi"
msgstr "An error occurred"

msgid "Kechirasiz, xatolik yuz berdi"
msgstr "Sorry, an error occurred"

msgid ""
"Sahifa vaqtincha ishlamayapti. Iltimos, birozdan so'ng qayta urinib ko'ring."
msgstr "The page is temporarily unavailable. Please try again shortly."

#, python-format
msgid "Sizni %(sana)s kunidagi marosimimizga taklif qilamiz"
msgstr "We invite you to our celebration on %(sana)s"

msgid "Oqqushlar — chiroyli elektron taklifnomalar"
msgstr "Oqqushlar — beautiful digital invitations"

msgid ""
"O'zbekiston uchun eng chiroyli va zamonaviy elektron taklifnomalar. Bir "
"necha daqiqada yarating."
msgstr ""
"The most beautiful and modern digital invitations for Uzbekistan. Create "
"yours in a few minutes."

